    "rationale": "Target dense y=22–25 band where multiple edges (e.g., [9,13], [11,13], [7,14]) incur detours due to vertical congestion. Move nodes 13,14 down to y=24 to align with neighbor anchors and reduce vertical routing span; shift 16,18 to y=27 to compress top layer and free y=28–31 for cleaner fanout to POs. Lower layer nodes 7,8 moved to y=21 to close gap near inputs and enable shorter paths from PI0–PI3. Swap 9↔11 to balance x-positions: 9 (now at 29,22) better serves 13’s x=28, while 11 (now at 28,22) reduces crosstalk with 9’s former path and improves symmetry with 7/8. All moves stay within vacancy hotspots (e.g., window_25_31_25_31, window_18_27_18_28) and preserve no collisions. This coordinated contraction targets area reduction via y-height compression (current height=12 → projected 11) while maintaining fanin order and minimizing Manhattan edge growth."
